# Shivering Isles. SE02 "Through the Fringe of Madness", after 0000_se01_door (SE01Door 201 set SE02 5 and the player stands at
# SE01DoorMarkerREF, west of Passwall in the Fringe). The quest has two ways to kill the Gatekeeper: Jayred's bone arrows
# (stages 50 60 70 80 90, drafted here) and Relmyna's tears (25 30 130 140: Nanette's secret, the love letter, spying on
# Relmyna's midnight visit, the handkerchief; not drafted). Either way the Gatekeeper's death sets 150, the player takes the
# keys from the corpse (160 / 161 / 162 by SE02QuestScript), Haskill is summoned to talk (SE02.HaskillGreet 2), a Gates of
# Madness door then lets the player through and entering the Realm sets 190. 200 is SE03's.
# DRAFT 2026-11-17: not run yet.

# SEGatesOfMadnessDoorScript: the first activation of a Gate while SE02 < 7 sets 7 (the door is locked: XLOC level 100, key
# SE02KeyToMania / SE02KeyToDementia). The player lands on XSEGatekeeperProtectGates, about 2000 from the gate, and walks to it;
# the landing is within 3000 of SE02OrcCaptainRef, so SE02OrcCaptainScript starts the scene as it would for a player coming
# up the road: the adventurers fight the Gatekeeper (SE02OrcCaptainOrders, killed one by one), the captain runs off and his
# GameMode / OnDeath sets 10. After 10 the Gatekeeper is hostile again (SE02GatekeeperScript), so the player leaves: a moveto
# to XSE02ConversationSpotA, on the Passwall side, stands in for walking back.
case se02_gates
run
player.moveto XSEGatekeeperProtectGates
wait 60
# A walk to the gate ends 128.4 from its centre against its collision and never counts as arrived (run si_2a):
# moveto the gate, as the sewer-exit gate case does.
run
player.moveto SEFringeToManiaREF
wait 30
activate SEFringeToManiaREF
until 300 GetStage SE02 >= 7
# The captain's orders (fightStage 1..7, which ends in 10) begin only once the player is within 1024 of him
# (warnPlayerDoOnce; run si_2b sat at 7 with the player at the gate, 2,300 away). A player on the road from Passwall
# passes him; approach stands in.
approach SE02OrcCaptainRef
until 7200 GetStage SE02 >= 10
run
player.moveto XSE02ConversationSpotA
wait 60
end

# Jayred Ice-Veins (SEJayredIceVeinsRef) is at home or wandering round SEPasswallWanderRef (his package list, ordered: eat
# 12-14 and 18-20 at the inn, wander 10-20, sleep 0-6), so the hour is set to 15 and the player waits for him to be outside.
# After 10, "Gatekeeper" (INFO 0008E4C8, say once, sets SE02.JayredGardens) adds "Gardens of Flesh and Bone" (INFO 0008E4F7,
# sets 50) which offers "Lead on." (INFO 0008E4F5, goodbye: 60, SEJayredIceVeinsRef.LeadToGardens 1, a lockpick). With
# LeadToGardens 1 his package SE02JayredEscortPlayerToGardens leads to XSE02JayredFindBones (-50378 360), 10000 units west and
# past SE02GardenCourtyardGateRef (locked). An escort walks on only while the player is close behind, so the player follows
# (`follow`) and he stops at the gate, saying SE02JayredSayUnlockGate ("Hurry! Pick that lock open.", GetLocked, within 512).
case se02_jayred_lead
run
set gamehour to 15
until 3600 SEJayredIceVeinsRef.GetInCell SEPasswallJayredsTent == 0
run
player.moveto SEJayredIceVeinsRef
wait 120
approach SEJayredIceVeinsRef
talk SEJayredIceVeinsRef
ask "Gatekeeper"
ask "Gardens of Flesh and Bone"
until 300 GetStage SE02 >= 50
ask "Lead on."
until 300 GetStage SE02 >= 60
bye if open
follow SEJayredIceVeinsRef
hear 9000 SEJayredIceVeinsRef Hurry
follow
end

# The gate is picked by the player (lockpicking is not a step: `unlock` stands in) and opened; SE02GardenCourtyardGateScript
# then enables SE02GardensSpawn1Ref..3Ref. Jayred goes on to XSE02JayredFindBones, where SEJayredIceVeinsScript sees
# GetInCell XPGardens (the Gardens' dummy parent cell, which holds XPGardensExterior) and sets EscortedPlayerToGardens 1 and
# FindBones 1; SE02JayredFindBones ends (OnPackageDone) with "Here we are!" and 70. The player follows and fights beside
# him (`defend`). His SE02JayredForceGreet (70 done, 80 not) says INFO 00012067 ("From these Gatekeeper bones I can make some
# arrows.", say once), which offers "When will these bone arrows be ready?" (INFO 0003EA9C: 80, sets ArrowMakingStartDay and
# ArrowMakingFinishHour = GameHour + 2).
case se02_gardens
walk SE02GardenCourtyardGateRef
run
SE02GardenCourtyardGateRef.unlock
wait 30
activate SE02GardenCourtyardGateRef
defend SEJayredIceVeinsRef
follow SEJayredIceVeinsRef
until 9000 SEJayredIceVeinsRef.EscortedPlayerToGardens == 1
until 9000 GetStage SE02 >= 70
hear 3600 SEJayredIceVeinsRef From these Gatekeeper bones
ask "When will these bone arrows be ready?"
until 300 GetStage SE02 >= 80
bye if open
follow
end

# SEJayredMakeArrows (80 done) takes him to SEJayredShootArrows in his tent. "Bone Arrows" (added by INFO 00012067; INFO
# 00012063, SE02.metaStageArrows 80) is only offered once his script's finish hour or day has passed (GameHour above
# ArrowMakingFinishHour, or GameDaysPassed above ArrowMakingStartDay); midnight is passed by setting the hour, as a player
# waits (as in oblivion_main/0500). The result sets 90, gives 20 bone arrows to both and offers "Follow me." / "Wait here."
# ("Follow me.", INFO 00012065, goodbye: SEJayredIceVeinsRef.FollowWaitToggle 1 starts SE02JayredFollowPlayer).
case se02_arrows
run
set gamehour to 23.9
wait 300
run
set gamehour to 10
player.moveto SEJayredShootArrows
until 9000 SEJayredIceVeinsRef.GetInCell SEPasswallJayredsTent == 1
wait 120
approach SEJayredIceVeinsRef
talk SEJayredIceVeinsRef
ask "Bone Arrows"
until 300 GetStage SE02 >= 90
ask "Follow me."
until 300 SEJayredIceVeinsRef.FollowWaitToggle == 1
bye if open
end

# Jayred follows the player out of the tent (the player takes the door, SEPasswallJayredsTent's 00011FC2) and over the
# ground; two moveto hops with a wait for him to catch up stand in for the walk (the Gatekeeper's ground is about 9000 from
# his door). SE02JayredFightGatekeeper takes him into the fight within 3000 of XSEGatekeeperProtectGates. SE02GatekeeperScript
# (leash round the same marker) makes the Gatekeeper attack the player there, so the player lands on it and fights
# beside Jayred (`defend`); with the orc scene over (10) he is no longer essential. His OnDeath sets JournalTimer 4 and 150
# (SE02FIN starts, congratulatePlayer 1). Jayred's SE02JayredCongratulatePlayer (150 done, under 200, within 1000) force-greets
# with INFO 00012F37 ("The Gatekeeper is slain. Congratulations. ...").
case se02_gatekeeper
activate 00011FC2
wait 120
until 1800 SEJayredIceVeinsRef.GetInCell SEPasswallJayredsTent == 0
run
player.moveto XSE02ConversationSpotA
until 3600 SEJayredIceVeinsRef.GetDistance player < 600
run
player.moveto XSEGatekeeperProtectGates
defend SEJayredIceVeinsRef
until 9000 GetStage SE02 >= 150
hear 3600 SEJayredIceVeinsRef The Gatekeeper is slain
bye if open
end

# SE02GatekeeperScript OnDeath adds SE02KeyToMania and SE02KeyToDementia to the corpse (stage under 150); the player takes
# them (RemoveAllItems stands in for looting; the Gatekeeper is SE02Gatekeeper1Ref for a player under level 3, see
# SEDoorToShiveringIslesScript). SE02QuestScript then sets 162 (both keys) and moves Haskill to the player with
# SEHaskillSummonForcegreet: INFO 00081DDF ("So, you've managed to kill the Gatekeeper. Pity. ..."), whose result sets
# SE02.HaskillGreet 2 (the quest script makes it 3 and fades him out after 5 s).
case se02_keys_haskill
run
SE02Gatekeeper1Ref.RemoveAllItems player
until 600 GetStage SE02 >= 162
hear 1800 SEHaskillREF managed to kill the Gatekeeper
until 600 SE02.HaskillGreet >= 2
bye if open
end

# The Gates of Madness: with 160 and SE02.HaskillGreet 2 (before that the door says "You must speak with Haskill first."),
# activating a Gate with its key takes the player through (SEGatesOfMadnessDoorScript gives the blessing and unlocks the
# other door). The player walks the last stretch from XSEGatekeeperProtectGates to SEFringeToManiaREF. Entering the Realm
# (SE02QuestScript: player.GetInCell SEGatesOfMadness) sets 190, which shows the map markers and ends the quest's journal.
case se02_gates_of_madness
run
player.moveto XSEGatekeeperProtectGates
wait 60
run
player.moveto SEFringeToManiaREF
wait 30
activate SEFringeToManiaREF
until 900 GetStage SE02 >= 190
end
